{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029222453918-1029_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261029223829\"/><p>內地女子疑存入假美鈔惹官非。</p><p>今午(29日)5時35分，銅鑼灣告士打道281號一銀行職員報案，懷疑有人儲存的一張面額為100美元鈔票是偽鈔。警員接報到場，經初步調查後，以涉嫌「行使偽製紙幣」，拘捕一名姓張(36歲)內地女子，她現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:23:03.149129+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:24:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T15:18:26.592208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:18:26.592208+00:00","content_hash":"7f947b9c460968f0271f6a37ecf6ad1eb51ff741ea9a960378d1e0c13785c026","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}